Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.87,0:00:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened on the 29th of April, the first day of Golden Week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, my mother's husband's second wife is my current "mother,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and her second husband is my current "father."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So in short, your current parents aren't really your parents at all... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn't that something you wouldn't normally tell a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents are rather frank, so I heard about it before elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I must really be a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They apparently wanted to send me to an orphanage, but didn't, to save face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.85,0:00:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I tried to be a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Though really, a good kid is just a normal kid, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.51,0:01:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}When your family situation is so complex, there are times when people are biased against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}But I decided that I wouldn't change simply because of trivial things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.06,0:01:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I mean, it's Golden Week, after all. Aren't you going to study or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I have to study during Golden Week?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I like to take walks on days off,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,because I don't want to be at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Spending a whole day at home with my parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,freaks me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I take walks on days off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're worrying too much... but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with the gauze on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you promise not to tell anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I... promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning, my father hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit you? That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Araragi-kun, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}If you heard an ignorant child talking about something that's none of her business,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.91,0:02:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you might be a bit annoyed, or get a bit angry...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn't that understandable?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Violence is understandable?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.76,0:02:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you're okay with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.45,0:02:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the one thing you find most unforgivable?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay! It's only one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised, you know, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised that you wouldn't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But... a promise like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Araragi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't tell anyone about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.65,0:03:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't tell, I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.65,0:03:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan, I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey there, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.05,0:06:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.55,0:06:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan, it's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.10,0:06:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well if that's it, you should really be thanking Kanbaru instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Has she come by here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but before I could say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,she ran off faster than the eye could see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She must've had something really important to do. Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... it was like a Lightspeed Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.31,0:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Why would you use the special attack used by Prince Yamato from Bikkuriman to describe her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.25,0:07:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3\fscx90}Even worse than being hard to understand, I can't even follow up on the joke without it turning into an explanation!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...  I didn't expect you to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.63,0:07:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan, you're as interesting as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But what should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.55,0:07:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than talking to Kanbaru-san, I had other things to do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, I'd be more than willing to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I still need to thank Kanbaru-san myself, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't ask you to do that, Koyomi-oniichan...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't consider something like this to be work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Well, then I guess it's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.31,0:07:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already been washed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.98,0:07:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could return it for me, I'd be really grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Sengoku. Can I ask you about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.56,0:08:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing big.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about Shinobu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.15,0:08:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Last night after getting rid of the Jagirinawa, we went back to the old school,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.27,0:08:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and since it was late, we stayed the night, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a cute little girl with blond hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she say anything to you while I wasn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.45,0:08:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a vampire, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but right now, I guess she's more of a pseudo-vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:09:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's her fault that you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't her fault. It was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, trying to place the blame on an aberration isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They're merely trying to exist, and that's just how they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Even aberrations have some semblance of reason for the things they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.19,0:09:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That basically sums it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.41,0:09:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, don't worry about stuff like that too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be best if you just went back to living a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.34,0:09:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have any problems, feel free to come and talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Though of course, if you have any really big problems, Oshino may be better able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he did warn me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.35,0:09:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just always rely on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like how if you constantly rely on Doraemon's secret gadgets, you become like Nobita-kun. {rinTLC: LOL}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Oshino-san that gave you the protective seal, too. That really {\i1}is{\i0\fscx140} {\r}like Doraemon's secret gadgets!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the Genius Helmet or Skill Gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}Why would you go out of your way to use minor secret gadgets that only showed up in the movies as examples?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Use something like the Takecopter or the Anywhere Door instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.39,0:10:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan, you always follow up on my jokes perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.01,0:10:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.47,0:10:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing... really...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like my manhood is being measured when I'm around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.77,0:10:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:10:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about Shinobu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She... was constantly glaring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I feel like her eyes were different when she was looking at you and Oshino-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,than when she was looking at me and Kanbaru-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that she looks at men and women differently?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.27,0:11:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really aware of people's looks... so I can just tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, if it isn't Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.49,0:11:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hanekawa, this is the girl{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.07,0:11:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,E-E-Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, I think I'm a little hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Umm... yeah, that's my sister's friend that I mentioned yesterday, Sengoku Nadeko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.17,0:12:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Araragi-kun, what happened after that snake incident?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.82,0:12:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Well, it was basically solved. Though we really just ended up relying on Oshino again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really understand, but it's good that it was solved swiftly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, she really did seem like a nice, sweet girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken, that uniform is from the middle school you graduated from, isn't it, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You really do know everything, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.71,0:12:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I know everything. I just know what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.93,0:12:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you had something to do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:13:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}By any chance, was talking to a cute middle school girl the "something" you had to{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That was something concerning Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just embarrassing, so I didn't want to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara-san, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to hear some interesting rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Doesn't sound interesting at all, but I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}"Ever since Senjougahara became friends with Araragi, she's started acting strangely."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.95,0:13:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"Araragi is being a bad influence on Senjougahara."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Just a bit ago, Hoshina-sensei asked me, "Hanekawa, do you know anything about this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.47,0:13:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really know how you and Senjougahara-san got so close,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think people are going to start saying even more things like that from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... they probably will, won't they.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}That's a big problem for you. From now on, you'll need to prove that things aren't like that, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't just let people say bad things about Senjougahara-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,like how going out with some guy caused her to go bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well anyway, I told him otherwise.\NI told him I didn't think it was like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But do you really think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. I never lie, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Other than you, I've never heard anyone but liars use that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I think there are plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.91,0:14:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Honestly, I really feel that Senjougahara-san is developing in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.41,0:15:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's thanks to\Nrecovering from her illness, or thanks to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.23,0:15:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think that you need to be by\Nher side to support how she's changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't talk like a high school{highschool?} student, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I think I'm perfectly normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, I wonder if Hanekawa has someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the kind of person that's gentle with anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wonder if she has that one special person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.21,0:15:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm... about Doraemon's secret gadgets{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.94,0:15:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.59,0:15:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.48,0:16:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah... I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worrying too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa, this can't be like that time during Golden Week, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Week, the 9 day period between April 29th and May 7th.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.05,0:16:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She was possessed by a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Meddlecat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Meddlecat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's also known as Silver Cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.97,0:17:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But really, Meddlecat is its more customary name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cat without a tail; one that doesn't leave anything behind.{i'm trying to avoid rhyming here. D:}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that, Oshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.63,0:17:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}If we're talking in terms of "reality," then I'd say it's a kind of multiple personality disorder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the inner personality of your President{rinTLC: how did we tl this before?}{nomae: I have no clue, and would rather not look through every ep of the show to find it, if it is later fixed... also fix the lines at 18:01 and 18:20} manifesting itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The black, bad Hanekawa Tsubasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.06,0:17:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's call her "Black Hanekawa."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's {\i1}white.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what's outside, but rather, what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Araragi-kun? You're more impatient than normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.53,0:17:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Even when you were assaulted by monsters over spring break, you weren't this distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And? How are we going to get Hanekawa back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.96,0:17:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, don't worry. I'll explain just how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.19,0:17:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, there's a reason that the black President,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.45,0:17:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,or rather, the Meddlecat, is appearing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.03,0:18:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That reason is likely stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Stress?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably an extreme amount of stress, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Like the large amount of stress that accumulates over a long period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, the President isn't under any kind of stress, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be love, or studies, or perhaps her family...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Night after night, Black Hanekawa attacked passersby without discrimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,By doing this, it was attempting to relieve Hanekawa's stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the Meddlecat's characteristics as an aberration is energy drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.05,0:18:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fscx95}Like when it often appears in video games, it is the power to absorb strength and energy from people you touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Of those who were energy drained, the worst were hospitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.45,0:19:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Two people were hospitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.81,0:19:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They were the first, and most serious, victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.27,0:19:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They were also the cause of Hanekawa's stress...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, on the final day of Golden Week, May 7th...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, human, I've trapped you nyow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Showing off, trying to follow me around...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.89,0:19:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really knyow what you're trying to do, but it's pointless, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Until my myaster's stress is completely gone, I won't be going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And speaking of which, if that stress is nyot relieved in a year...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu... no, she didn't yet have the name Shinobu at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.25,0:20:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,One of her characteristics as a vampire is, like the Meddlecat, energy drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}But to compare a Meddlecat to a vampire... the level of aberration is completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Meddlecat, which could also be said to be the avatar of Hanekawa's stress,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,was drained by Shinobu's energy drain, and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.79,0:20:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa's stress was, for the time being, reduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that, the problem was solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.28,0:21:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems just like that time during Golden Week,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.27,0:21:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,though nothing out of the ordinary is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hanekawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.19,0:21:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.79,0:21:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go... no, the school infirmary's closed by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.11,0:21:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'm fine. You're blowing this out of proportion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you said this has been happening often, lately...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm telling you, you're worrying too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really a chicken sometimes, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.93,0:21:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are kind, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q3}More importantly, Araragi-kun, have you been trying to understand Senjougahara-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not enough to just understand, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to put it into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.14,0:21:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for always making you worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.95,0:22:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, if you really understand\Nwhat I'm saying, Araragi-kun, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Those bloomers and school swimsuit\Nthat you're clutching like treasures...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should at least put them in your bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.82,0:23:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.63,0:23:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already reached the 11th preview!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.69,0:24:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is the 11th one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.74,0:24:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,11 is a prime number, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.21,0:24:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly is prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.91,0:24:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the definition of a prime number?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.60,0:24:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A number that is not divisible other than itself
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.45,0:24:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,or a positive integer other than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.93,0:24:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is that number?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.90,0:24:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fake number.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.21,0:24:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what's the definition of a prime number?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.01,0:24:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A positive integer, not a prime number.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.38,0:24:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a number!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.18,0:24:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A prime number, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.92,0:24:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the closing puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.01,0:24:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.64,0:24:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the difference between a puzzle and a quiz?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.04,0:24:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Puzzles are tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.93,0:24:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Quizzes are hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.06,0:24:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.51,0:24:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So tricky!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.72,0:24:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, Tsubasa Cat Part Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.56,0:24:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's the definition of a mantissa?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.56,0:24:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
